* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-misunderstand.wav|a=Southern England}}
* {{IPA|en|/mɪs.ʌn.dɚˈstænd/|a=RP}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Wodencafe-misunderstand.wav|a=US}}
