===Verb===
{{en-verb|misunderstands|misunderstanding|misunderstood}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[understand]] [[incorrectly]], while believing one has understood correctly.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2024|author=NTSB| title=Intersection Crash Between Passenger Car and Combination Vehicle, Tishomingo, Oklahoma, March 22, 2022
 | passage= We found that teen drivers and the public largely '''misunderstand''' the legal status of cannabis use and do not fully recognize the risks of cannabis-impaired driving.
}}

